From: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: select primary UMAC before peer association

Select a preferable shared-REO radio before WMI association, keeping the
association link independent. Configure per-link routing at creation;
defer shared queues until all partner peers are present. Preserve the
existing per-link-queue path and keep the owner stable across retries.

Based on JiaY-shi primary-link selection and Qualcomm TIP hardware
preference flags, including QCN6432. Guard partial setup and cleanup.

Signed-off-by: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
